                    >https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jHM7JzsNyvQ&amp;t=7s</a>
            </p>
            
            <p>
                H2 Unreal. (2025). How to Add Muzzle Flash &amp; Dynamic Impact - Unreal Engine 5 Weapon System Tutorial. YouTube. Accessed 30
                June at <a
                    href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aaC3rIW_mFc&t=576s"
                    >https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aaC3rIW_mFc&amp;t=576s</a>
            </p>
            <h3>Assets</h3>
            <p>
                FX Cat UA. (2020). Realistic Starter VFX Pack Vol 2. Fab.
                Accessed 30 June at <a href="https://fab.com/s/b7603e0a549d"
                    >https://fab.com/s/b7603e0a549d</a
                >
            </p>
            <p>
                Deadghost Interactive. (2018). FPS Weapon Bundle. Fab. Accessed
                30 June at <a href="https://fab.com/s/4e9d5df313a2"
                    >https://fab.com/s/4e9d5df313a2</a
                >
            </p>
            <p>
                Epic Games. (2014). Animation Starter Pack. Fab. Accessed 30
                June at <a href="https://fab.com/s/5b8a9c9d3c77"
                    >https://fab.com/s/5b8a9c9d3c77</a
                >
            </p>
            <p>
                cstys1994. (2025). Old Military Ammo Box, Crate, Scan.
                Sketchfab. Accessed 30 June at <a
                    href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/old-military-ammo-box-crate-scan6e42c388bb1a4f299ea00c509b1b69dd"
                    >https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/old-military-ammo-box-crate-scan6e42c388bb1a4f299ea00c509b1b69dd</a
                >
            </p>
        </main>
        <Footer/>
    </body>
            <VideoScript />

</html>
